OL,3,APolice to give update on fatal US
OL,4,Aschool shooting after Trump praises
OL,5,Abystander 'hero'
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour people, including a teacher and
OL,8,Fchildren aged five, eight and 11, were
OL,9,Fkilled in a shooting at Silver Rail
OL,10,FElementary School in Bend on Thursday
OL,12,FThe suspected attacker has been
OL,13,Fidentified as 16-year-old John Griffin,
OL,14,Fthe BBC's US partner CBS News reports
OL,16,FGriffin was shot dead by a father whose
OL,17,Ftwo daughters attend the school.
OL,19,FUS President Donald Trump praised
OL,20,FKaylub Giamanco as a "great hero"
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
