OL,3,APolice to give update on fatal US
OL,4,Aschool shooting after Trump praises
OL,5,Abystander 'hero'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSchools in the district will remain
OL,8,Fclosed today "due to the tragedy",
OL,9,Fofficials say, as the community grieves
OL,10,Fthose it lost
OL,12,FBBC Verify looks at how common shooting
OL,13,Fincidents at US schools have become
OL,14,Fover the last 15 years
OL,16,FLocal authorities will give an update
OL,17,Fat 14:00 PT (17:00 ET, 22:00 BST)
